{
  "uid": "loki-dev-troubleshoot",
  "title": "研发排障 - 实时日志",
  "description": "给研发快速定位服务问题用：选服务 -> 看直方图定位时间点 -> 读日志流。默认「范围=业务服务」，已排除 loki/kube-system 等基础设施日志（它们占全部日志的 96%）。Java 异常堆栈已在采集端合并为单条记录。系统服务(kubelet/containerd 等)把范围切成「含系统日志」。",
  "tags": [
    "loki",
    "logs",
    "dev",
    "troubleshoot"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 0,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "project",
        "label": "项目",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "project",
          "refId": "project",
          "type": 1
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "环境",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "environment",
          "refId": "environment",
          "type": 1,
          "stream": "{project=~\"$project\"}"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "scope",
        "label": "范围",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "业务服务 : ^(loki|kube-system|alloy|local-path-storage|_system)$, 含系统日志 : ^(loki|kube-system|alloy|local-path-storage)$, 全部 : ^$",
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "业务服务",
            "value": "^(loki|kube-system|alloy|local-path-storage|_system)$"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "含系统日志",
            "value": "^(loki|kube-system|alloy|local-path-storage)$"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "全部",
            "value": "^$"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "业务服务",
          "value": "^(loki|kube-system|alloy|local-path-storage|_system)$"
        },
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "refresh": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "description": "默认「业务服务」排除 loki / kube-system / alloy 等基础设施命名空间和宿主机日志——它们占全部日志的 96%，不排掉的话开发者找自己服务的日志像大海捞针。要看基础设施切「含系统日志」或「全部」。"
      },
      {
        "name": "source",
        "label": "日志来源",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "source",
          "refId": "source",
          "type": 1,
          "stream": "{project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\"}"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "命名空间",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "namespace",
          "refId": "namespace",
          "type": 1,
          "stream": "{project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace!~\"$scope\"}"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "app",
        "label": "服务",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
        },
        "query": {
          "label": "app",
          "refId": "app",
          "type": 1,
          "stream": "{project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", namespace!~\"$scope\"}"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "label": "关键字",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "description": "在日志正文里搜索，留空则不过滤。例：orderId=123"
      },
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "级别",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "trace,debug,info,notice,warn,error,critical,fatal,unknown",
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "trace",
            "value": "trace"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "debug",
            "value": "debug"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "info",
            "value": "info"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "notice",
            "value": "notice"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "warn",
            "value": "warn"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "error",
            "value": "error"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "critical",
            "value": "critical"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "fatal",
            "value": "fatal"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "unknown",
            "value": "unknown"
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "refresh": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "description": "按 Loki 推断的 detected_level 过滤，覆盖全部日志。不用索引标签 level：它只覆盖约 5% 的日志，用它筛会让绝大多数 Pod 日志消失。"
      },
      {
        "name": "rate_window",
        "label": "速率窗口",
        "type": "interval",
        "query": "1m,5m,10m,30m,1h",
        "auto": false,
        "refresh": 0,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "5m",
          "value": "5m"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "1m",
            "value": "1m"
          },
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "5m",
            "value": "5m"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "10m",
            "value": "10m"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "30m",
            "value": "30m"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "1h",
            "value": "1h"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "日志速率",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate({project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", namespace!~\"$scope\", app=~\"$app\"} | detected_level=~\"$level\"  |= \"$search\" [$rate_window]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "条/秒"
        }
      ],
      "description": "当前筛选条件下的日志速率。受「范围」影响——默认不含基础设施日志。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "错误数",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", namespace!~\"$scope\", app=~\"$app\"} | detected_level=~\"$level\"  |= \"$search\" |~ `(?i)(^|[^a-z])(error|fatal|panic|exception)([^a-z]|$)` [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "条"
        }
      ],
      "description": "仪表盘时间范围内含 error / fatal / panic / exception 的日志条数。刻意不做阈值着色：这个数随时间范围线性变化，固定阈值在改范围时必然失真。判断是否异常看右边的「错误占比」。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "错误占比",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", namespace!~\"$scope\", app=~\"$app\"} | detected_level=~\"$level\" |= \"$search\" |~ `(?i)(^|[^a-z])(error|fatal|panic|exception)([^a-z]|$)` [$__range])) / sum(count_over_time({project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", namespace!~\"$scope\", app=~\"$app\"} | detected_level=~\"$level\" |= \"$search\" [$__range])) * 100",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "%"
        }
      ],
      "description": "错误日志占全部日志的百分比。比「错误数」更适合判断是否异常——比例不随时间范围变化，而计数会。阈值按实测基线定：本环境常态 9.9~10.1%（5m/30m/1h/6h 四个窗口都一样，demo 应用按固定比例造错误），所以 20% 才转橙、40% 转红。**换到真实环境必须重新量基线再定**，见坑位 19。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 40
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "涉及服务数",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
          },
          "expr": "count(sum by (app) (count_over_time({project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", namespace!~\"$scope\", app=~\"$app\"} | detected_level=~\"$level\"  |= \"$search\" [$__range])))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "个"
        }
      ],
      "description": "仪表盘时间范围内出现过日志的服务数量。具体是哪些服务，展开「服务与级别分布」折叠行。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "日志量（按级别）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (detected_level) (count_over_time({project=~\"$project\", environment=~\"$environment\", source=~\"$source\", namespace=~\"$namespace\", namespace!~\"$scope\", app=~\"$app\"} | detected_level=~\"$level\"  |= \"$search\" [$__interval]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{detected_level}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "按级别堆叠的日志条数直方图，分桶宽度自动跟随视图（$__interval）。先在这里看出几点开始异常，再往下读日志——这是读日志的标准顺序，直接翻日志流很容易错过起始时间点。不受顶部「速率窗口」影响：那是滑动窗口，会把直方图糊成一整块。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "interval": "30s"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "实时日志流",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "efzm3ndgkowsga"
